Edit
SELECT 
  f.FISERV_PREMIUM_RECORD
FROM stage_misreg.stage_cip_premium_feed_details f
WHERE param_num = '202505'
  AND EXISTS (
    SELECT 1
    FROM misreg.TPOLICY tp
    WHERE tp.policy_no IN ('0041000566','0041000706')
      AND SUBSTR(f.FISERV_PREMIUM_RECORD, 31, 10) = tp.policy_no
      AND TO_DATE(SUBSTR(f.FISERV_PREMIUM_RECORD,63,10), 'yyyy-mm-dd') = tp.inception_dt
  );
✅ Goal: Ensure clean integration—every record matches inception, policy, and code changes.

